UnitDiscountRegistry::RegisterPoolFeeFloorExemption
├── when caller isn't the owner
│   └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is the owner
    ├── when account address eq zero
    │   └── it reverts with AccountIsZero
    └── when account address does not eq zero
        ├── when pool address eq zero
        │   └── it reverts with PoolIsZero
        └── when pool address does not eq zero
            ├── it sets poolFeeFloorExempt to the new exempt flag
            └── it emits PoolFeeFloorExemptionSet
